Board-only suite: the goldens are STM32-L476RG_raw ones (mem_space_*.STM32-L476RG_raw.scout, .st_nucleo.ascomp), so host runs (Mac, pix, nix) skip this directory. The STM32-L476RG_raw board run includes it; the ESP32-S3_raw run skips it through ESP32-S3_raw.skip. A host run that names it with TRIAL_SUITES still runs it (and fails: there are no host goldens).
